# Requires: MS1 on :8080, Ollama on :11434 (qwen3-embedding:0.6b, qwen3:4b), MS2 on :8000
# Start MS2 (from ms2-rag-service):
#   python -m venv .venv ; .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install .
#   $env:MS2_ADMIN_API_KEY='dev-admin-key' ; .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --port 8000

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

###
### Reconcile index with MS1 (index missing/changed notes, remove deleted ones)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/index/reconcile
X-API-Key: dev-admin-key

###
### Rebuild the whole index from scratch
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/index/rebuild
X-API-Key: dev-admin-key

###
### Admin endpoint without key -> 401
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/index/reconcile

###
### Ask a question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the transformer architecture?"
}

###
### Ask a question with custom top_k
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is Spring Boot?",
  "top_k": 2
}

###
### Invalid request (empty question) -> 422
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

###
### OpenAPI spec (Swagger UI: http://localhost:8000/docs)
GET http://localhost:8000/openapi.json

###
### Ask a question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What does xd mean?"
}

###
### Ask a question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What number is light gray? why?"
}
